<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
<title>RubixWorld Launcher</title>
<hta:application
  id="app"
  applicationname="RubixWorld Launcher"
  border="thin"
  caption="yes"
  maximizebutton="no"
  minimizebutton="no"
  scroll="no"
  showintaskbar="yes"
  singleinstance="yes"
  sysmenu="no"
  windowstate="normal"
/>
<style>
  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}
  body{
    background:#0a0708;
    color:#f5f5f5;
    font-family:'Segoe UI',Tahoma,sans-serif;
    padding:40px 20px;
    user-select:none;
    cursor:default;
  }
  .card{
    max-width:520px;
    margin:20px auto;
    border:1px solid #2a1f21;
    background:#0d0a0b;
    padding:40px 36px;
    text-align:center;
  }
  .tag{
    display:inline-block;
    padding:6px 14px;
    border:1px solid #e8b23a;
    color:#e8b23a;
    font-size:11px;
    letter-spacing:3px;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    margin-bottom:24px;
    font-family:Consolas,monospace;
  }
  h1{
    font-size:22px;
    font-weight:900;
    color:#ffffff;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    letter-spacing:1px;
    margin-bottom:20px;
    line-height:1.35;
  }
  p{
    color:#c9c2c4;
    font-size:14px;
    line-height:1.7;
    margin-bottom:12px;
  }
  .accent{color:#D500FF;font-weight:700;}
  .btn{
    display:inline-block;
    margin-top:24px;
    padding:14px 36px;
    background:#D500FF;
    color:#ffffff;
    border:none;
    cursor:pointer;
    font-family:inherit;
    font-size:12px;
    font-weight:800;
    letter-spacing:2px;
    text-transform:uppercase;
  }
  .btn:hover{background:#E93FFF;}
  .foot{
    margin-top:26px;
    font-size:10px;
    letter-spacing:2px;
    color:#5a5254;
    font-family:Consolas,monospace;
    text-transform:uppercase;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="tag">RubixWorld Launcher</div>
    <h1>Вы временно не можете скачать данный лаунчер</h1>
    <p>Попробуйте позже.</p>
    <p>Следите за новостями в наших соц-сетях (см. <span class="accent">сайт</span>).</p>
    <button class="btn" onclick="window.close()">Понятно</button>
    <div class="foot">RubixWorld // Minecraft Server</div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>